[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Advanced StrictDoc Features Example

[SECTION]
TITLE: System Overview

This document demonstrates advanced StrictDoc features including requirements, links, references, and structured content.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-001
TITLE: System Authentication
STATEMENT: The system shall provide secure user authentication using multi-factor authentication (MFA).
RATIONALE: Security is critical for protecting user data and system integrity.
TAGS: security, authentication, mfa
LEVEL: High
STATUS: Draft

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-002
TITLE: Data Encryption
STATEMENT: All sensitive data shall be encrypted at rest and in transit using AES-256 encryption.
RATIONALE: Data protection compliance and security best practices require encryption.
TAGS: security, encryption, compliance
LEVEL: High
STATUS: Approved

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: Technical Requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-003
TITLE: API Response Time
STATEMENT: The API shall respond within 200ms for 95% of requests under normal load conditions.
RATIONALE: User experience requires fast response times for interactive applications.
TAGS: performance, api, user-experience
LEVEL: Medium
STATUS: In Review

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-004
TITLE: Database Backup
STATEMENT: The system shall perform automated daily backups with point-in-time recovery capability.
RATIONALE: Data protection and disaster recovery require reliable backup mechanisms.
TAGS: backup, disaster-recovery, data-protection
LEVEL: High
STATUS: Approved

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: User Interface Requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-005
TITLE: Responsive Design
STATEMENT: The user interface shall be responsive and work on devices with screen sizes from 320px to 1920px width.
RATIONALE: Users access the system from various devices including mobile phones and desktop computers.
TAGS: ui, responsive, accessibility
LEVEL: Medium
STATUS: Draft

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-006
TITLE: Accessibility Compliance
STATEMENT: The user interface shall comply with WCAG 2.1 AA standards for accessibility.
RATIONALE: Ensuring accessibility for users with disabilities is both a legal requirement and good practice.
TAGS: accessibility, compliance, wcag
LEVEL: High
STATUS: In Review

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: References and Links

This section demonstrates how to include references and links in StrictDoc documentation.

REFERENCE: https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/quickref/
TITLE: WCAG 2.1 Quick Reference

REFERENCE: https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/
TITLE: OWASP Top 10 Security Risks

[/SECTION] 